==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] at any significant level, even a level 20, you can beat this stage with ease. If you lack it, however, then things become a bit trickier. Spawn a [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] to handle the early enemies, and let it hit the base. At a decent enough level, it can hold off Nyandam while the two One Horns spawn, which you can lure to your base. Defeat them using [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja]], and with the stack formed, make sure to save enough money to spawn a rusher to forcibly tank Nyandam as the the One Horns fall, so the stack doesn't die to Nyandam.

